---
---

<section class="section intro-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-grid">
      <div class="intro-heading-col">
        <div class="reveal-fade-up" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          <h6 class="subtitle">AMENITIES</h6>
          <h2 class="title">
            Discover your potential:<br/>
            <span class="text-primary">Venture your best chess school</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        
        <div class="intro-stats-grid-single">
          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
            <h3>Free Trial / Class Demo</h3>
            <p>A trial session to spark interest and assess a student's current skill level.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
            <h3>One-to-One Coaching</h3>
            <p>Personalized lessons tailored to individual skill levels, including customized game analysis and flexible scheduling.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
            <h3>Group Classes</h3>
            <p>Structured group sessions that promote social interaction and regular practice with peers.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
            <h3>FIDE-Rated Instructors</h3>
            <p>Training from certified coaches rated by the International Chess Federation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="intro-content-col">
        <div class="intro-stats-grid-single">
          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.5s;">
            <h3>Child-Focused Curriculum</h3>
            <p>Age-appropriate syllabus designed for different learning stages (from beginner to advanced).</p>
          </div>

          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.6s;">
            <h3>Progress Tracking & Certificates</h3>
            <p>Regular tracking of student progress and certificates awarded upon level completion.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.7s;">
            <h3>Online & Offline Tournaments</h3>
            <p>Organized events to prepare students for external competitions.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="intro-text-card reveal-fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.8s;">
            <h3>Skill Levels & Batches</h3>
            <p>Structured courses (e.g., Pawn, Knight, Bishop, Rook, Queen, King levels) to support gradual advancement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro-section {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    margin: 2rem;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .title {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .text-primary {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .intro-stats-grid-single {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .intro-stat-card {
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .stat-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .stat-desc strong {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro-text-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .intro-text-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .intro-text-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
